     grid, hand-cut corners, handwriting font and crooked sticky notes, drawn in chalk-white pencil instead
     of graphite. The highlighter is the same yellow, laid on thinner so light text stays readable over it,
     and the accent is a light blue pencil. Icons are the same pencil sketches with a light outline
     (ThemeIcons, style Sketch). Same keys as Sketchbook.xaml; only the colours differ. This file is
     Sketchbook.xaml with every colour remapped, so the long lists of small rectangles are the same textures. -->
